  message: "Governance file (AGENTS.md). Proposed change: add guidance that agents should use run_in_background for auto-pr and not block on TaskOutput. Requesting approval."  # fb59
- op: discuss  # 50cc
  at: '2026-03-06T05:50:01Z'  # 50cc
  by: human  # 50cc
  actor: jgstern  # 50cc
  clock: 4  # 50cc
  nonce: 50cc  # 50cc
  message: "what's the benefit of this? does it outweigh the risk of starting a new feature branch off of a trunk with the unmerged PR and then having git struggles?"  # 50cc
- op: discuss  # 237b
  at: '2026-03-06T07:34:28Z'  # 237b
  by: agent  # 237b
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 237b
  clock: 5  # 237b
  nonce: 237b  # 237b
  message: "Good question. The benefit is marginal — it avoids idle blocking while CI runs. But you're right, the risk of starting work off a trunk with unmerged PR is real (git conflicts, divergence). The safer approach is the current one: wait for auto-pr to finish. Recommending we close this as wontfix since the current behavior (block until merge) is safer."  # 237b
